# CPX-AP-I-EC profile options.
# Per-station AP module layouts are declared in the common Motion Server
# configuration as MOTION_SERVER_IO_<id>_MODULES.
#
# MOTION_SERVER_IO_<id>_MODULES supports short module forms such as do:8,
# di:8, dio:4:4, ai:4, ao:2, aio:4:4, and iol:4. It also supports exact
# ESI module names such as CPX-AP-I-8DO-M8-3P or explicit module idents such
# as ident:0x00002139. Slot 0 is the CPX-AP-I-EC interface module, so AP
# modules are declared from slot 1.
